Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:44.95,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 12: MALICE SANG PEDANG SUCI
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:47.81,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,ELYMAS EDVAUGHN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.30,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SKILL TREE KESATRIA KELAS BERAT: LV41
